  "bodyHash": "154ca7da6c9ce5f4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Minecraft-1.19 | 1.16 | 1.14 | 1.12 | 1.11 | 1.9-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"524\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Better Animations Collection（更佳动画合集）</strong> 旨在通过更换游戏内模型来实现更流畅的动画和细微效果，从而提升《我的世界》的氛围。它力求为适合改进的游戏部分带来更真实的质感，例如模拟物理效果以及让原本静止的模型部件动起来。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>颤动恶魂触手</strong> 将恶魂触手拆分为多个部分，并让它们像电影里的触手怪一样真实地摆动。虽然增加了一丝恐怖感，但整体视觉效果更加美观。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蜿蜒鱿鱼触须</strong> 为鱿鱼的游泳动画添加类似水母的效果，并使其触须在移动时更加飘逸。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>欢快小狗</strong> 使狼尾巴变得更加蓬松飘逸，站立和奔跑时会真实地摇摆。此外，驯服的狼会改为趴下而不是坐着。举起肉块时，它们还会打滚。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飘逸豹猫尾巴</strong> 移除现有豹猫僵硬的尾巴，换上更美观的设计。尾巴完全支持动画，站立或奔跑时会自然摆动。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>卷曲猫咪尾巴</strong> 也将豹猫引以为傲的流畅动画尾巴带给了猫咪。不仅如此，猫咪坐下时尾巴还会卷曲在身体周围！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>哼哼小猪</strong> 添加了非常细微的动画效果，使猪在哼叫时鼻子会微微上下晃动。虽然幅度很小，但确实存在。为你的家畜增添一丝生机。别忘了它们还有飘逸的大耳朵！对于这么小的动物来说已经很大了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>抖动奶牛乳房</strong> 使奶牛行走时乳房随之晃动。同时为其添加了乳头，如果你对此比较敏感，可以在设置中关闭该功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蹦蹦小鸡</strong> 使鸡在咯咯叫时喙部开合。喙部也变得更加纤细，从此再也不会把鸡和鸭子搞混了！昂首阔步时头部前后摆动，肉垂左右摇晃，翅膀也会轻微扇动。就像真的一样！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>颤动村民鼻子</strong> 进行了细微改动，使村民在发出独特的“嗯哼”声时鼻子会微微晃动！虽然只是小改动，但谁能不觉得有趣呢？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>颤动铁傀儡鼻子</strong> 与上面完全相同，只不过针对的是铁傀儡！由于它们不会发声，受伤时鼻子会随之晃动。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>液态史莱姆</strong> 带来令人愉悦的视觉变化：史莱姆内部像液体一样流动。跳跃时内部晃动感更强。眼睛、嘴巴和核心都会独立运动。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>岩浆怪汉堡</strong> 为岩浆怪添加了自定义死亡动画，死亡时身体会变成一堆冒着热气的美味汉堡肉饼。遗憾的是，你不能吃它们，因为太烫了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蜘蛛膝盖</strong> 是一项真正惊艳的视觉添加。蜘蛛现在终于拥有了它们梦寐以求的膝盖。洞穴蜘蛛同样适用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>抖动苦力怕</strong> 唤起了人们对早年 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2rDbRUDkds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CaptainSparklez</span></a> 创作的 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">那支非常火爆的音乐视频</span></a> 的回忆。还记得那只超级可爱的抖动苦力怕吗？现在它正式加入游戏了。完整还原，原汁原味，和视频里一模一样。可能是整个合集里最好的自定义动画。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>狂舞末影人</strong> 愤怒的末影人在追逐目标时会疯狂挥舞手臂。非常符合它们扭曲的特性：疯狂摇摆充气手臂管状末影人！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>动态雪人棍</strong> 使雪人在扔雪球时手臂能够摆动。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>跪姿绵羊</strong> 设计十分巧妙。它使绵羊真正弯腰吃草。不再是仅仅低头，而是整个身体下沉去品尝那美味的纤维素。你注意到它们跪下时膝盖也会弯曲了吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>经典马匹</strong> 让马匹重新变得生动起来，就像旧版本那样。在保持原版模型风格的同时，重新添加了嘴部和膝盖的动画。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>吐口水羊驼</strong> 使羊驼在吐口水时张开嘴巴。以前它们是怎么做到的呢？！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>类人膝盖弯曲</strong> 使僵尸类和猪灵类生物行走时膝盖弯曲。看起来非常流畅自然。你会喜欢的，相信我。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒体：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/889/2021-07-29_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/376/50/2021-06-30_14.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蹦蹦小鸡</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>跪姿绵羊</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/756/2021-07-28_21.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/106/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>哼哼小猪</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>抖动奶牛乳房</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/201/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/202/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>经典马匹</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>吐口水羊驼</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/193/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/111/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>颤动村民鼻子</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>颤动铁傀儡鼻子</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/110/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/109/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>卷曲猫咪尾巴</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>飘逸豹猫尾巴</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/196/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/107/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>欢快小狗</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>动态雪人棍</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/108/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/190/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蜘蛛膝盖</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>液态史莱姆</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/757/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/758/2021-07-28_09.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>狂舞末影人</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>抖动苦力怕</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/725/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/200/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蜿蜒鱿鱼触须</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>类人膝盖弯曲</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/728/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/192/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>颤动恶魂触手</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>岩浆怪汉堡</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aQKmdRYwvGk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3oko18JERQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>预告片由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEq5O5WCb2tTngspsMsyrrQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loook</a> 制作</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>评测由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7SktcUK2OPYQwe123rJVbg\" rel=\"nofollow\">JKapGaming</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BS0OOQJ5jQw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3I7i7oENjFI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>评测由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyZA5Ysa33gA89sCdWJQojQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">CavemanFilms</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>评测由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKlhpmbHGxBE6uw9B_uLeqQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sky Does Everything</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JGk4mXX6QQc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qkFSPBTdqXA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>评测由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH-_hzb2ILSCo9ftVSnrCIQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">YOGSCAST Lewis &amp; Simon</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>评测由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">CaptainSparklez</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SEqjHrJlYy4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4DYa_7KAdd8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>评测由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS5Oz6CHmeoF7vSad0qqXfw\" rel=\"nofollow\">DanTDM</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>评测由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqg2eLFNUu3QN3dttNeOWkw\" rel=\"nofollow\">iHasCupquake</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：如何配置此模组？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安装我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，即可在游戏内直接进行配置！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>问：是否支持自定义资源包？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>支持！Better Animations Collection 中的所有动画均由原版资源构建而成，未使用任何额外的纹理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在开发 Better Animations Collection 的过程中，本项目得到了以下人员的帮助与启发：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/KodaichiZero\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>KodaichiZero</strong></span></a> 几乎承担了所有功劳，因为他在多年前的 Minecraft 1.2.5 中创建了这些出色的模型和动画（作为原始 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1284100-1-2-5-the-better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Animations Collection</span></a> 的一部分）。继续开发本项目的书面许可可在此处查看：<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fD7CiEnf.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这里</span></a>。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tr9zw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Tr9zw</strong></span></a>，其模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Not Enough Animations</span></a> 的部分物品检视动画为本项目提供了灵感。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/almightytallestred\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Almightytallestred</strong></span></a>，其模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-eating-animation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Player Eating Animation</span></a> 的部分进食动画为本项目提供了灵感。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freshlx_official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>FreshLX</strong></span></a>，其资源包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fresh Animations</span></a> 中的漂浮猪耳朵设计为本项目提供了灵感。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ftrayblock%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>TrayBlock</strong></span></a>，其附加包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fimproved-vanilla-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Improved Vanilla Mobs</span></a> 中的纤细鸡喙设计为本项目提供了灵感。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center